<title>USA: T Cell Sciences Inc Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>T Cell Sciences Inc Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM, Mass. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.09     loss	 $0.01</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 2,355     loss	   158</p>
<p> Revs			   327			857</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,965		   18,717</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.50     loss	 $0.47</p>
<p> Net	   loss	10,790     loss	 8,258</p>
<p> Revs			 1,115		    3,963</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,693		   17,482</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net loss for the fourth quarter of 1995 included non-operating gain of $2.9 million for a settlement of a lawsuit.</p>
<p>Net loss for fiscal 1996 included a $1.8 million write-off of certain capitalized patent costs and a $400,000 charge resulting from a severance agreement with a former president and chief executive officer.</p>
